	rule_text:
		You may look at the top card of your library at any time.
		You may cast permanent spells from the top of your library as though they had Dash. The Dash cost is equal to their mana costs.
		You may play Lands from the top of your library. If you do, they gain “<kw-a><nospellcheck><key>Haste</key></nospellcheck></kw-a>” and “At the beginning of the next end step; Return this Land to its owner’s hand”. Each turn, you may play an additional Land this way.
